      "value": "I've found that calling Input.GetAxis(\"Joy1 Axis 4\") and Input.GetAxis(\"Joy1 Axis 5\") work for the left and right triggers on PC. They return -1 for triggers untouched, 0 for half-pressed, and 1 for fully-pressed.\n\nThis doesn't work on iOS - I haven't found any axes set up for the triggers.",
